'P',1.0,,,/                    ** 2 SECOND SAMPLING TIME
/                              ** 30 SECOND FILTER TIME CONSTANT
'PLER:(N-1)',0.93333/          ** from 86-PS-401, p.4-3
'PLER',0.06667/
/
/
 
'SET PARAMETER','SET01'/
'SAMPLING TIME'/
0.0/
 
